abstract: >-
  Operational, evidence, provenance, and reproducibility infrastructure for the
  preregistered longitudinal audit of research software identity propagation
  across open scholarly infrastructures. This repository is research
  infrastructure and is not an eleventh object in the fixed ten-object study
  corpus.
